      "markdown": "## Start before sunset\n\nLeave the station a little before the light goes\\. The first stop is a small workshop\\: see the [evening pottery session](/experiences/evening-pottery-session)\\.\n\n![A lantern over a shop door \\(sample photo\\)](https://assets.editor.example/photos/figure-1.jpg \"Sample caption\")\n\n## Sit down somewhere\n\n- Bring a ***light*** jacket\\.\n- Keep some coins for the bus\\.\n\n:::note\nThis is a sample note inside the guide\\.\n:::\n",
